# CMake/MSBuild output, test binaries, runtime logs and PIX captures
build/
# Release packages (package.ps1)
dist/
out/
.vs/
*.user

# Python caches from tools/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Disassembly and RTTI dumps of the game executable: local only, never committed
analysis/
# Local analysis tools (CMake's SIM_QVFR_LOCAL_DIR; probe/local_analysis.h): the developer's own, never committed. Their
# usual place is outside every checkout; inside one, local/.
local/
# Reverse-engineering notes on the games' engines, one file per game: local only, never committed
docs/recon-ace.md
docs/recon-acc.md
docs/recon-xplane.md
# ... and any later game's (docs/recon-<game>.md), or the old single file
docs/recon-*.md
docs/recon.md

# NVIDIA's DLSS SDK (NGX headers and libraries, nvngx_*.dll, its licence): local only, never committed or published.
# Builds take it from NGX_SDK_DIR (CMake) or package.ps1 -NgxSdk; inside a checkout its place is
# third_party/nvidia-dlss-sdk/ (CMake finds it there). Its files are ignored anywhere else in the tree too.
third_party/nvidia-dlss-sdk/
third_party/ngx-sdk/
nvsdk_ngx*.h
nvsdk_ngx*.lib
nvngx_*.dll
NVIDIA-RTX-SDKs-LICENSE.txt
